  <h1>Privacy</h1>
  <p>LateNotary is a static website. The first version of these pages does not set analytics cookies, advertising cookies, or an account system.</p>
  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <p>If you email us, we receive whatever you include in the message and the address you send it from, and we use that only to reply or to update a listing. If you click an external or affiliate link, that destination site has its own privacy policy.</p>
  <h2>Hosting logs</h2>
  <p>Whatever host serves these files may keep ordinary server logs such as IP address, browser type, and the page requested. We do not control a host’s logs until a host is chosen and this policy is updated.</p>
  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>If we add analytics, a comment form, or another tool that collects personal information, we will update this page before that tool goes live.</p>
